title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1): Settings > Record timer 3 s, REC starts the countdown, Esc cancels it (nothing written), REC again records at zero
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1200
key s
wait 500
tap "Record timer"
wait 400
tap "3 s"
wait 500
expect text "3 s"
shot settings-timer
key esc
wait 400
tap "REC"
wait 700
shot countdown
key esc
wait 600
expect noquit
shot countdown-cancelled
tap "REC"
wait 4300
shot recording-after-countdown
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
key l
wait 600
expect text "Take 001"
expect notext "Take 002"
shot list-one-take
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
